WEBVTT

00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.940
RAINBOW

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:54.230
What are you doing, Satoru?

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.820
Satoru was about to run away, Katsuragi.

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.570
Why?

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:04.200
Why would I run away with you?

00:02:04.410 --> 00:02:06.710
I'm the one who crushed Mr. Hayashi.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.880
You can finish him off, Katsuragi.

00:02:11.040 --> 00:02:13.090
That's up to the Company to decide.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:16.340
In that case, hurry up
and make the decision.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.970
This is it. It's all nearly over.

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:24.470
I'm the only pet who's of use now.

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:29.940
Hiroki and I can finally be together.

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.650
What happened out there?

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:35.110
Why didn't I run away...?

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:36.280
Tsukasa?

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:38.610
I can't understand it, Hiroki...

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.490
Mr. Hayashi told me to run away.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:47.160
So why... why did I...?

00:02:47.910 --> 00:02:50.000
Why did it have to be this way?

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:53.500
I can't run anywhere anymore.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.760
Wherever I go to sleep, I see
Mr. Hayashi in my dreams.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:03:00.180
I'm standing there completely still.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:03.720
I can't escape that place, Hiroki!

00:03:05.640 --> 00:03:09.020
What am I supposed to do...?

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:13.270
What do you want me to do, Tsukasa?

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.400
Try anything funny and your next piercing
will be made of lead, Satoru.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:20.360
-Just sedate him instead, Katsuragi!
-Jin...

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.860
Take Meiling back to her room.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:24.160
He had this in his pocket.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.370
Huh? Is that...?

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.750
It's your precious little box, Katsuragi.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.130
Search your memories, Katsuragi!
I am Mr. Matasa, remember?

00:03:35.380 --> 00:03:37.710
Enough nonsense, the CEO will deal with...

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:40.920
Jin! Get down!

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.260
Katsuragi, dead ahead!

00:03:49.520 --> 00:03:50.770
Long!

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:54.520
Shit... I killed Mr. Long.

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:56.020
You did what you had to.

00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:58.150
Long, Long!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.360
Give me a hand. We gotta go!

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.740
You said you'd take this somewhere safe.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.580
I will! But first we need
to get out of here.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.370
You asshole!

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:14.620
Stop! Katsuragi is your father!

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.250
Say what...?

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:20.630
Mr. Hayashi hid your memories!

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:22.010
You're lying!

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.680
There's an oddly shaped bag
inside Katsuragi's memory.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.470
If you open it up, his hidden memories
will come back!

00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:29.260
Huh?

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:30.640
I don't believe you.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.020
Meiling, release your butterfly!

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.350
Weird...

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.650
He promised me I wouldn't be killed.

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.280
What?

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:46.570
Katsuragi, you have my word that
I'll never put out a hit on you.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:49.620
Damn you, Satoru!

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.120
I need to get out of here quickly.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.630
It can't be...

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:03.130
Shit! What am I supposed to do now?

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:13.390
Katsuragi! You knew what
would happen to Lianlian

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:15.230
if she gave birth in her condition!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:19.440
I lost my beloved little sister
because of you!

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:24.740
I will make sure you're no more than
a stranger to Jin while she lives here!

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:26.490
Mr. Katsuragi.

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:31.120
Lianlian is close to becoming your peak.

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:33.660
If your memories of her are removed,

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.620
I think it's likely you'll be crushed.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:40.040
So the CEO won't kill me,
but is happy to crush me, huh...

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.300
So be it. Let's get it over with, Hayashi.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.470
I've come up with another way.

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:50.350
It'll mean hiding half of your peak,

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.770
so it might have an effect
on your personality.

00:05:55.390 --> 00:05:57.140
But even if we do it that way,

00:05:57.440 --> 00:06:00.440
I still won't recognize
my own daughter, right?

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:04.690
Having a family was my dream.

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:09.660
Lianlian knew that, too.
So she had my child even though she...

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:12.160
I'm the one who killed her.

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.990
Don't forget, Mr. Katsuragi,

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:17.210
you were also the one
who taught her how to smile.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:21.880
She had never smiled once,
until she met you.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:24.960
Miss Lianlian!

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.590
Miss Lianlian!

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.220
Hey, Hayashi!

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:37.230
Lianlian saw you coming home
so she ran out to greet you.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.480
She seems to prefer being with you
to being in my care, Mr. Kakuragi.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:44.230
It's "Katsuragi"!
Hey, hands off my glasses!

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:47.740
Lianlian enjoys teasing you.

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:49.280
Seems that way...

00:06:49.450 --> 00:06:52.990
I suppose it's because everyone else here
treats her with kid gloves.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:57.160
Miss Lianlian!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:06.500
Quit your yelling, would you...?

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:10.880
This is when you say "welcome home".

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:13.640
Welcome home.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.390
It's nice to be home, Lianlian.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.280
Tsukasa, get away from Hiroki!

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.450
Hiroki...

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:40.540
What did you do to Tsukasa...?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:47.250
Requesting backup... Mr. Long has been...

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:52.470
Miss Lianlian. Please come out of there.

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:53.800
What are you doing?

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:58.430
She's been working today,
so she is a little off balance.

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.690
We tried to get her in the bath,
but she ran off.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.810
Get them out of here, Hayashi.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:08.610
Let's leave it to Mr. Katsuragi.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:12.070
What, to that strange-looking
Japanese guy?

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:16.830
Do they really think I still
don't understand Mandarin?

00:08:19.410 --> 00:08:21.410
Come on, Lianlian.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.830
You can come out now.
There's no need to be embarrassed anymore.

00:08:28.750 --> 00:08:30.670
Welcome home,

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.090
Tadashi.

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:35.340
Give me those will you!

00:08:36.390 --> 00:08:38.560
Give those back, Lianlian.

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:44.100
I'll get it in the neck from your brother
if I'm late, you know.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.280
Okay.

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:53.360
Look, Lianlian.
I'm going to take your picture.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:57.120
A picture. Okay?

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.870
That's it. Stand still now.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.460
Give me back my glasses.

00:09:06.670 --> 00:09:08.630
I can't take a decent photo
without them.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:20.510
You're beautiful, Lianlian.

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:25.310
No matter what anyone says,
you're not pitiful...

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.690
nor are you a monster.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.320
You're the kindest,

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:32.570
most beautiful woman in the world.

00:09:38.660 --> 00:09:39.700
Lianlian?

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.910
You were told you couldn't come in here.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:46.410
Welcome home... Tadashi.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.380
We're not allowed to play
together anymore.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.170
I'll hit you if you come closer!

00:09:56.510 --> 00:09:58.180
I love you...

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.430
God dammit!

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:14.690
No!

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:19.200
Katsuragi! Please... wake up!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.870
What's wrong, Lianlian?

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:27.710
Are you crying?

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:45.850
Mr. Long!

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.020
Jin! Please calm down!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.400
Hey, get over here!

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:56.400
What happened?

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.900
Tsukasa's not right...

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.630
What're you doing, Tsukasa?

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.840
I told you to take it easy.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:22.300
You were taking a while,
so I was worried about you.

00:11:22.510 --> 00:11:23.850
I'm fine.

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:26.390
I even found the next carrier pigeon.

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:30.310
At least we're out of Japan, now.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:35.650
It's a good job we went with
your plan back then.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:39.280
Tsukasa...

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:41.650
What do you want me to do?

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.160
I want you to run away with me.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:46.660
Tsukasa...

00:11:47.240 --> 00:11:49.790
Let's get out of here. There's no time.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.170
What's wrong with your leg?

00:11:53.630 --> 00:11:56.670
I got shot.
I'll need a shoulder to lean on.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.840
Are you two okay?

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:07.640
Are you sure it's okay to take
a guest's car like this, sir?

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:11.060
Don't sweat it.
We're guests too, right?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.060
Hiroki.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.310
Let's swap cars at the next rest stop.

00:12:15.650 --> 00:12:18.270
You can look at my memories there

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:20.860
and confirm the escape route.

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:22.570
Look at your memories?

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:25.160
Yeah. My memories of when I...
I mean, when Satoru...

00:12:25.320 --> 00:12:28.080
read the files on the USB stick.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:31.580
I'll need your help, Hiroki.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:33.830
What're you talking about, Tsukasa?

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.460
I said I wouldn't leave you, didn't I?

00:12:36.920 --> 00:12:39.380
Oh, yeah. Of course you did.

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:43.720
Hey, Tsukasa.

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.930
You spent forever with the customs guy.
Was there a problem with your passport?

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:52.600
He could speak Chinese,
so we made small talk for a while.

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:54.190
Oh, okay.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:58.560
I thought you'd had to hypnotize him
or something.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.860
I want to sleep, Hiroki.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.490
Tsukasa?

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:13.750
Tsukasa!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.460
Over here, Hiroki.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.840
You scared me.
I thought you'd disappeared.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.880
I wanted to catch the sunrise.

00:13:21.590 --> 00:13:25.680
The thought that we're nearing our goal
makes me kind of restless.

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:27.510
Huh?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.060
What's up with that piercing?

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:34.770
Crap... I guess I've reached my limit.

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:36.560
Limit?

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.730
I put you under hypnosis to ensure
your memories made sense

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:43.440
even after I hid one of them.

00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:45.240
What're you...?

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.530
I'm going into your peak.

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:50.280
Take a look, Hiroki.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:53.620
Satoru?

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:56.910
The memory I hid is in that tank.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:02.800
What do you want me to do?

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:05.970
What do you want me to do, Tsukasa?

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.380
I want to sleep, Hiroki.

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:12.310
I want to sleep a deep, dreamless sleep...

00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:17.230
You want me to remove
your memory of crushing Hayashi?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:19.100
No! That's not enough.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:20.690
I'd just...

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.320
I'd just end up looking for him.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:26.570
If I thought he'd vanished,
I'd search desperately for him.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.820
Then I'd go on searching
to find out who'd crushed him.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:33.280
There's nothing else that can be done...

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.330
You have to erase Mr. Hayashi
from my memory.

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:40.580
If I erase your peak giver
from your memory,

00:14:40.790 --> 00:14:43.590
the peak he shared with you
will disappear too.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:47.090
If that happens, your entire being
will disappear.

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.930
So I can't erase your peak giver.

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:52.140
But...

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:55.220
I could replace him.

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:58.230
Will I do?

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:00.980
Can I replace Hayashi with myself?

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:05.730
It means I'll become your peak giver,
if you're okay with that.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:12.570
Thank you, Hiroki.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.080
But...

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.420
Let's go to my valley.

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:27.840
It didn't go as easily as we'd hoped.

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.340
This dog is the keyhole.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.430
I'll give it a shot.

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:44.270
Xiwang.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:49.820
I'm sorry I'm late, Xiwang!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:56.330
Isn't this the mutt the CEO
told us to dispose of?

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.460
You've caused enough commotion.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.460
If you want to keep secrets,

00:16:06.750 --> 00:16:09.630
you'll need a stronger lock.

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:22.390
Xiwang!

00:16:23.190 --> 00:16:25.610
You're still alive!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:39.700
Tsukasa's lock was too strong.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:43.290
The more we forced it open,
the more messed up his memories became.

00:16:51.920 --> 00:16:53.720
Wee-wee-wee.

00:16:58.640 --> 00:17:00.810
You can go back now, Hiroki.

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:02.980
Here it comes!

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:10.110
Tsukasa said he took care to balance out
different memory loci

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.990
when combining them to make his lock.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:22.620
Are you okay, Hiroki?

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:27.670
But in protecting me, he kept destroying
elements of his own valley.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.090
No more...

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:31.840
Tsukasa!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:34.300
Forever...

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.880
Forever...

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:39.680
Forever...

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.060
Forever...

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:45.140
Flowing forever and ever.

00:17:45.560 --> 00:17:47.480
This whole ocean...

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.900
It all flowed here from far away.

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.900
What you said was true, Mr. Hayashi!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:55.700
I finally made it here!

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.200
Tsukasa!

00:17:58.360 --> 00:18:00.830
Turning into a fish is a great idea.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.040
I'm water, after all.

00:18:03.580 --> 00:18:05.500
We can be together forever.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.880
Wait, Tsukasa!

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:14.710
I need to...

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:18.180
I need to make it yellow all over.

00:18:18.760 --> 00:18:20.760
Today more than ever.

00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:22.930
No, not this one...

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:28.560
Please don't erase this memory.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.310
-Hiroki!
-Please not this one!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.940
I made the whole pan yellow today!

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.580
Tsukasa!

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.510
Tsukasa.

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:21.200
In the end...

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:24.530
all of Tsukasa's memories disappeared,

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.660
including every moment
of our time together.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:37.090
Scoop up a little.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:44.140
Listen to me, Tsukasa.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:46.720
You too can be free, just like this water.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.850
Having an image will grant you
that freedom.

00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:54.190
It will give you the power to create
your own future.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:58.860
I've got to erase Hayashi.

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:02.860
That's why I've come here.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.640
That's right...

00:20:25.470 --> 00:20:28.100
I wasn't able to save Tsukasa.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:33.560
And then, I just left him there...

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:37.900
You tricked me, Satoru!

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:40.940
You promised you'd change
my memories, remember!

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:44.280
I destroyed all of Tsukasa's memories!

00:20:44.570 --> 00:20:47.660
How can I live with myself after that?

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.950
Hiroki, please help me!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:54.290
Without you, I've no chance of escaping!

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:55.920
In that case,

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.250
you help me too, Satoru.

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.250
Running away...

00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:02.760
is meaningless if it's without Tsukasa.

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:05.760
Change my memories, please...

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:09.850
I asked you to erase
Tsukasa from my mind!

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:14.640
I don't think that would help you.

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:18.150
You erased Tsukasa's memories
in an attempt to help him.

00:21:18.480 --> 00:21:22.570
I guess you thought you could erase
the mistakes he had made.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:27.030
But Tsukasa must have known that
he would disappear completely.

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:29.700
He is such a fool.

00:21:29.910 --> 00:21:33.450
His entire history with Mr. Hayashi,
and with you,

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:36.870
he just made it all out
to be one big mistake.

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:42.300
Mr. Hayashi, too, said finding me
was where the mistakes all started.

00:21:42.710 --> 00:21:45.260
I thought that was horrible of him.

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:49.350
His finding me made me who I am today.

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:52.720
So I decided I was gonna get out,
no matter what.

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:57.810
I thought if I could escape and survive,
it would mean none of this was in vain!

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:02.570
If I could be free, it wouldn't
have all been a mistake.

00:22:02.780 --> 00:22:04.690
Satoru. Look...

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:20.380
You will find me there waiting for you.

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:23.630
So that scenery really did exist...

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:28.590
Mr. Hayashi said that he'd made
someone else's peak his own.

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:32.640
He must have realized it was
a real landscape from somewhere

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:34.890
and searched until he found it!

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:37.390
He wanted to show it to us!

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:40.060
The wind taught me something.

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:42.480
It's Mr. Hayashi's wind.

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:45.650
I knew he hadn't made a mistake.

00:22:46.110 --> 00:22:48.700
Otherwise I would never
have made it here!

00:22:48.900 --> 00:22:50.610
It's just as he said,

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:53.990
we have the ability to freely shape
our own futures!

00:22:54.370 --> 00:22:56.910
I have to bring Tsukasa here.

00:22:57.250 --> 00:23:01.040
Not only Tsukasa,
but Mr. Hayashi too and Meiling!

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.210
We will take it back, Hiroki!

00:23:04.550 --> 00:23:07.010
We will take it all back!

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:15.560
Jin, don't blame yourself.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:18.020
Long is dead.

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:21.150
If anything were to happen to you too...

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:23.060
The one who died was Tsukasa.

00:23:23.360 --> 00:23:25.860
Long is still here,
where he should be.

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:27.110
Jin...

00:23:27.440 --> 00:23:30.240
Long just went back to being a baby.

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:33.950
I will take care of raising him myself.

00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:36.950
If I patiently teach him,
one bit at a time,

00:23:37.700 --> 00:23:40.460
I know he will become able
to create memories again.

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:44.960
Then one day, I'm sure...

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:48.960
he will avenge everyone!

00:23:50.130 --> 00:23:55.050
Artist: Ranjo Miyake
